The attraction offers free cancellation and includes complimentary water bottles, umbrellas, and a private live tour guide. The experience, operated by Rafael Tours, costs $9.71. You can be picked up from anywhere in Delhi, Gurgaon, or Noida, including the airport or any hotel.

Please remember to bring your ticket. The operator may cancel due to unforeseen circumstances. You must be at least 18 years old to book or be accompanied by an adult.

